t(26, 360, """A state like Germany or Japan boasts of making devices where the device lives 30 years, and they say "high quality"; then the same materialist world, over the span and age of the world of 1945, was telling people: your hearts, your pancreases, your livers, your kidneys, your lungs, your intestines and the rest inside your bodies age as you grow older!!! They lied and committed a crime by lying so much to people.

You make high-quality devices, and for eighty years you worked to convince people that the human body has no high quality in it! Allah is greatly exalted above your slander! You told people: the parts of the television sets we make, the parts of the expensive cars we make, the parts of the very expensive phone you make, the handbag that costs 100 thousand dollars, and our high-quality products do not age and their internal organs do not decay, while the Mighty Lord, the Creator, created a human whose internal parts are of low quality, aging, decaying and breaking down with age. You lied. Man's internal parts never ever age; they keep working at 1000% efficiency until the moment the soul departs and the moment of death. But it is you, with the 1945 world's diet, who made them fail and ruined them. The proof is far and near: Companions who fought extremely exhausting and grueling wars at the age of 70, and our grandfathers just yesterday, 70 years ago, who died with zero diseases!

Allah our Mighty Lord, holy are His names and attributes, magnified in the heavens and the earth, created our bodies with quality higher than high; so your liver, stomach, pancreas, intestines, lung and heart were created to work at 1000% efficiency for a thousand years, not just for 70 years .. Wake up""")

