t(27, 805, """I was asked about the discovered skeletons said to be dinosaurs!
Those behind the story of the earth forgotten in space did not want to say that! They had to say those skeletons were dinosaurs, because reptiles, even huge ones, a human can overcome, and they need no meteor coming from a supposed outer space to kill them, and that does not serve their narrative. Dinosaurs, as they were presented, are very huge creatures, so it is natural that a human cannot face them if his life on earth began in their presence. Therefore they can end only by a meteor that destroys the whole earth, or destroys the dinosaurs and leaves the earth. That is why they had to say they were dinosaur skeletons; but unfortunately we found small dinosaur skeletons, and we promise you that after 10 thousand years we will find you large dinosaur skeletons; just stay with us!""")

