t(27, 2235, """One of the followers asked me about the reason for inventing the dinosaur story. The answer, very briefly

The dinosaur matter is very important for proving that the earth is a globe and proving the existence of space and a void above the earth .. The heavenly religions clearly established that the earth is a plane closed by a dome, and the dinosaurs were bombarded from space according to their claimed narrative. So for them the dinosaurs are proof of the earth's sphericity and proof of a void above the earth, to prove that the earth is a ball hanging in space, forgotten, abandoned, unheeded by the Creator, and from this they argue that there is no creator at all; and at best they tell the youth of the West, then the East, that the Creator will not care about a ball the size of a speck of dust hanging in vast space, as they drew it. This is an important psychological effect for building a new awareness, which is (irreligion). For one who sleeps in a garden is, in people's eyes, an untidy, disheveled, dusty, unrespected person, while""")

t(28, 60, """one who sleeps in a house is a tidy, respected person. And the earth, according to what they say, sleeps disheveled and dusty on the open ground of space in a vast universe. So it was presented to the West and later the East as something whose size approaches nothingness, not deserving respect as a creature. This is important for making the Western personality that dominates world technology, which they knew would lead the world; important for building a distorted awareness of the Creator. But for Satan to control the earth, the Western personality had to be made atheist or irreligious, so the world could be turned into one village, the globalization they wanted; because religion has foundations that do not contribute to opening, establishing and spreading globalization. Therefore religion had to be neutralized from influencing the leaders of the world (the young men, men and women of the West), because every heavenly religion is a barrier wall against making globalization. And with globalization they wanted to spread unified, shared global moral values that change the youngest generations, and they succeeded through globalization's very powerful arm (the Internet). They wanted this, the building of a single global collective awareness, with the aim of defeating religions, Islam among them. Therefore even the Muslims, if they do not unite, are very open to being destroyed and annihilated, and this is a fact. Those behind the silly dinosaur story know this, and they are "deluded" that the Muslims will never unite, and they rely on this delusion. In sum .. the dinosaurs are nothing but the silliest part of the big silly story.""")

h(28, 1000, """The dinosaurs and the silly tale!""")

h(28, 2100, """There were no dinosaurs at all!""")

