t(29, 1435, """The secret by which the corrupt seller sells corrupt food to people! The secret by which the life of a person who thought he was walking the right path is stolen! The secret by which we can reap billions from selling harmful fertilizers and harmful foods, and even sell illusion to millions of the poor, and moreover make them fierce defenders of the falsehood we sell them! Do you understand now how strong ignorance is?! Ignorance of food and of the real standard of the good life; that ignorance which has spread through the nations since 1945, whose power is greater than the knowledge in books! It is an ignorance louder than the cries of the warners and admonishers. People's ignorance is the greatest secret of the success of the 1945 Matrix!

The 1945 Matrix knew very well that its success needed radio and television to dominate by spreading ignorance, not knowledge, among people, and to make people believe lies, because it is a matrix that grasps very well the power of ignorance! The simplest of the lies is that people believe everything written on packages, such as: (healthy) - (fresh) - (recommended by doctors) - (straight from the farm)!! Then it released the Internet and allowed it, knowing it would expose it, but it had reached a degree of self-confidence that made it not care! The 1945 Matrix today is fighting humanity with a late awareness humanity has acquired, because it is a matrix that thought everything to come would be earthly, and so it felt safe!""")

