t(35, 915, """He came out with a video about food in which he said what even Iblis did not dream of saying to harm the sons and daughters of Adam! A video in which he brought wonders and asserted errors no one before him had brought, the greatest of them in ignorance being his saying about the global pharmaceutical companies that they are specialized medical bodies: if they did not say something is carcinogenic, then it is not carcinogenic!! A catastrophic video, full of abject ignorance and full of everything contrary to scientific facts, not theories. Among the disasters he said: what is wrong with using hormones and accelerating substances for the growth of plants and chickens! And about white flour, which all the world's doctors forbid, Wagdi says: "Why deprive people?!" This is the lust for speech; it is the love of talking about everything and giving fatwas on everything, until the matter has reached harming people's health and lives!

O people, I have learned by experience that 99.9% of people in this age of ours stand on false speech and thought, so there is no use in addressing the talkers. Specialist doctors spoke to him, and he rejected the advice and insisted on spreading ignorance. So fear Allah regarding yourselves, and do not take from a sheikh what he does not understand.""")

